# https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SimpleLicensing/customIdToUri node775
node775 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>customIdToUri</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SimpleLicensing/customIdToUri' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SimpleLicensing/customIdToUri</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;**DEPRECATED in SPDX 3.1.**
Use [customIdToLicense](./customIdToLicense.md) instead.

Maps a &quot;LicenseRef-&quot; string for a custom license or a &quot;AdditionRef-&quot; string for
a custom license addition to its URI identifier.

